        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abesilisa bamaLevi ababalwa ngensendo, kusukela kulabo abalenyanga kusiya phezulu, bebalwa nguMose njengokulaya kweNkosi, babezinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lambili.",
