          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonke amazibulo esilisa abalwa ngamabizo, kusukela kulawo alenyanga kusiya phezulu, ayezinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lambili, lamakhulu amabili, lamatshumi ayisikhombisa lantathu.",
